### 1. Kalitga berilishi mumkin bo'lgan huquqlar (forma shu ro'yxatdan to'ldiriladi)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/api-keys/scopes
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 2. Kalit yaratish — javobdagi `key` faqat shu yerda ko'rinadi, saqlab qo'ying
POST http://localhost:8080/api/api-keys
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "name": "CRM integratsiyasi (prod)",
  "scopes": ["CONTACT_READ", "CONTACT_EDIT", "CAMPAIGN_READ", "CAMPAIGN_EDIT", "CALL_READ", "REPORT_READ"],
  "expiresAt": "2027-01-01T00:00:00Z"
}

### 3. Kompaniyaning kalitlari
GET http://localhost:8080/api/api-keys
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 4. Kalit bilan chaqirish — Bearer token o'rniga X-Api-Key
GET http://localhost:8080/api/campaigns
X-Api-Key: {{api_key}}

### 5. Allowlist tekshiruvi — kalitda BILLING_EDIT bo'lishi mumkin emas, 403 kutiladi
POST http://localhost:8080/api/billing/topup
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{api_key}}

{
  "amountUzs": 1000000,
  "paymentMethod": "PAYME"
}

### 6. Kalitni bekor qilish
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/api-keys/1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
